# Wallpaper for this theme, one "<output> <file>" per line.
#
# Files are names inside ~/Pictures/wallpaper, which is NOT tracked in this
# repo — see the note in the top-level README. bin/shell-theme builds the swaybg
# command from these lines and skips any file that is missing, so a machine
# without these images still gets a shell.
#
# This theme's whole palette is sampled from gon.png. Changing the image here
# without re-sampling consts/Theme.qml leaves the neon accents matching nothing.
eDP-1     gon.png
HDMI-A-1  alucard.png
